BIG 5 FORMAT

HEALTH: One fitness outcome.

MONEY: One revenue/client-acquisition outcome.

BUILD: One concrete commercial-project deliverable.

LEARN: One focused skill objective.

MI BUSINESS: One measurable business-development objective.

Do not overload the Big 5 with routine activities.

6. ROUTINE SOP

